      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MISCHIEVOUS EVIE (1) scored by 5 lengths last time (22.62) in a Grade 4/5 over 401m at this track. Looks suited here and rates on top. SLEEK APOLLO (4) had been racing in honest fashion recording two placings in a row before finishing fourth (29.25) at Bulli latest. Has a good record here including four wins. Form from his last run is proving to be solid. Cannot be taken lightly. DIESEL DASH (7) boasts a consistent overall record including five wins from 12 starts, the latest hitting the minor money when third (22.26) over 388m at Gosford. Meets a moderate line up and should run well. RED HOT WREN (2) saluted last start after racing on the speed. Hard to beat again.",
